1
00:00:08,851 --> 00:00:13,124
Medoro ka counter aapke device par hi apna
database rakhta hai,

2
00:00:13,164 --> 00:00:17,164
isliye internet band hone par bhi billing chalti
rehti hai.

3
00:00:17,204 --> 00:00:23,531
Counter screen par ek Counter PIN set kijiye;
offline hone par isi PIN se counter khulta hai.

4
00:00:24,308 --> 00:00:27,692
Ab is demo browser ka internet band karte hain.

5
00:00:27,732 --> 00:00:32,720
Sirf yahi browser offline hoga; baaki koi system
nahi chheda ja raha.

6
00:00:33,487 --> 00:00:36,196
Upar Live ki jagah offline dikhega.

7
00:00:36,236 --> 00:00:42,558
Phir bhi bill banaaiye: medicine khojiye, cart
mein daaliye, Cash chuniye aur F9.

8
00:00:43,332 --> 00:00:46,284
Bill ban gaya aur isi device par save ho gaya.

9
00:00:46,324 --> 00:00:50,121
Google Drive wale box mein 'Changes waiting'
badh gaya hai,

10
00:00:50,161 --> 00:00:53,764
yaani yeh badlaav upload hone ka intezaar kar
rahe hain.

11
00:00:54,536 --> 00:00:56,941
Ab internet waapas chaalu karte hain.

12
00:00:56,981 --> 00:00:58,263
'Sync now' dabaaiye,

13
00:00:58,303 --> 00:01:03,881
ya thoda rukiye; badlaav apne-aap encrypted
hokar Google Drive mein chale jaate hain,

14
00:01:03,921 --> 00:01:07,053
aur 'Changes waiting' phir shoonya ho jaata hai.

15
00:01:07,829 --> 00:01:11,726
Do counters ne offline rehte ek hi batch bech
diya ho,

16
00:01:11,766 --> 00:01:15,518
to sync ke baad woh batch minus mein dikh sakta
hai.

17
00:01:15,558 --> 00:01:21,497
Stock tab par laal ginti aati hai, aur stock
count karke use theek kiya jaata hai.

18
00:01:21,537 --> 00:01:24,049
Bills kabhi mit'te ya badalte nahi.

19
00:01:30,104 --> 00:01:33,401
Medoro mein aapki pharmacy ka data aapka hai.

20
00:01:33,441 --> 00:01:36,812
Bills, stock aur customers aapke counters par,

21
00:01:36,852 --> 00:01:40,074
aur aapke apne Google Drive mein rehte hain,

22
00:01:40,114 --> 00:01:43,560
us key se encrypt hokar jo sirf aapke paas hai.

23
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:48,305
Medoro ke paas sirf aapka account aur devices ki
list rehti hai.

24
00:01:49,062 --> 00:01:53,085
Counter har badlaav kuch seconds mein Drive mein
bhejta hai,

25
00:01:53,125 --> 00:01:55,455
aur samay-samay par poori copy bhi.

26
00:01:55,495 --> 00:01:59,315
Yeh files Drive ke hidden app data hisse mein
rehti hain.

27
00:01:59,355 --> 00:02:02,565
Is demo server par asli Google sign-in nahi hai,

28
00:02:02,605 --> 00:02:06,425
isliye Google Drive ka test version istemaal ho
raha hai.

29
00:02:07,195 --> 00:02:10,094
Restore: naya ya reset kiya hua counter,

30
00:02:10,134 --> 00:02:16,045
Drive recovery code se sab kuch waapas le aata
hai, har medicine, batch, customer

31
00:02:16,085 --> 00:02:16,706
aur bill.

32
00:02:16,746 --> 00:02:17,294
Yeh code

33
00:02:17,334 --> 00:02:24,347
aur sign-up wali recovery kit offline
sambhaalkar rakhiye; Medoro inhein recover nahi
kar sakta.

34
00:02:24,387 --> 00:02:28,020
Video mein koi key ya code nahi dikhaaya gaya
hai.

35
00:02:28,767 --> 00:02:31,784
'Privacy & data' screen par data controls hain.

36
00:02:31,824 --> 00:02:36,662
Strict customer-controlled mode mein customers
ke mobile numbers sirf owner

37
00:02:36,702 --> 00:02:38,809
aur manager ko poore dikhte hain,

38
00:02:38,849 --> 00:02:42,581
aur export mein number tabhi jaata hai jab
kaaran darj ho.

39
00:02:43,334 --> 00:02:46,902
Yahin se aap apna poora data export kar sakte
hain,

40
00:02:46,942 --> 00:02:51,217
aur zaroorat ho to kisi customer ka data mita
bhi sakte hain.

41
00:02:51,257 --> 00:02:57,229
Integration health screen batata hai ki kya juda
hai, kya test hua, aur kya fail hua.
